    0.104,
    "Chapter seven, lesson seven: bulk transport."
   ],
   [
    3.828,
    "An amoeba hunting in a pond meets a bacterium much too big to slip through any channel or carrier."
   ],
   [
    10.664,
    "So how does it get the meal inside?"
   ],
   [
    12.565,
    "Back at our patch of membrane, with the vesicles lit: small things cross through the bilayer or through proteins."
