   [
    0.156,
    "Think of the difference between a checkpoint and a delivery truck."
   ],
   [
    3.581,
    "Water, ions and small molecules pass one at a time, by the routes of the last lessons."
   ],
   [
    9.792,
    "Proteins, polysaccharides, even bacteria are far too large for that."
   ],
   [
    14.948,
    "They ride in a vesicle, a bubble of membrane, and the membrane itself opens and closes around them."
   ],
   [
    21.589,
    "Unlike diffusion, this takes energy."
   ],
   [
    24.18,
    "The cell has to spend A T P to move vesicles, and to bend and fuse the membrane."
   ],
   [
    29.987,
    "So bulk transport is a kind of active transport."
